          "old": "tutorial = \"The Divine is all that matters in a world of the immoral. \\\n\tThe Weeping God left his children to rule over us mortals--and you will preach their wisdom to any who still heed their will. \\\n\tThe faithless are growing in number. It is up to you to shepard them toward a Gods-fearing future; for you are a Bishop of the Holy See.\"",
